data: {"id": "f691721496244f41-final", "run_id": "f691721496244f41", "seq": 1258, "ts_ms": 1789109564618, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod内存资源请求（1Pi）远超集群可用内存，导致调度器在所有节点上均因'Insufficient memory'失败且无法抢占 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | 3/3 节点因 `Insufficient memory` 失败调度，`preemption: No preemption victims found` | 证明集群内存耗尽且无法抢占，直接解释调度失败原因 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Pod 配置 | `container.resource_request.memory`: `1Pi` | 揭示资源瓶颈根源：内存请求量（1Pi）远超常规集群规模 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Pod 状态 | `pod.status`: `Pending` | 描述异常持续存在的最终状态，符合无法分配资源的预期 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值 `1`，标签 `phase: Pending` | 通过监控确认 Pod 始终停留在 Pending 状态，未见成功或异常崩溃转移 |\n\n调度事件显示集群资源无法满足请求，且无抢占空间，这与 Pod 配置中高达 `1Pi` 的内存请求在逻辑上完全闭环；监控数据作为独立视角，证实了该异常状态已持续存在且稳定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod配置了 1Pi 的内存请求 → 集群内存资源无法满足 → 调度器在所有节点上触发 Insufficient memory 且无可用抢占对象 → Pod 处于 Pending 状态无法调度\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器内存资源请求（`1Pi`）严重超出集群可用资源，导致调度器无法为该 Pod 分配任何节点。\n\n这一结论由以下事实强支撑：\n- **资源配置事实**：容器 `app` 的 `resource_request.memory` 被硬编码为 `1Pi`（事实 #2）。\n- **系统反馈事实**：调度器明确拒绝该 Pod 并记录 `Insufficient memory`，且指出 `No preemption victims`（事实 #1），说明集群已无多余内存空间且未配置抢占。\n- **状态一致性**：Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态（事实 #3、#4），证明该资源缺口未被修复。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 49.5s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 26.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 26.0s (Evidence 21.5s, RCA 4.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 49.488, "metrics": {"run_id": "f691721496244f41", "mttr": {"value": "49.5s", "seconds": 49.494356632232666, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 49494.356632232666, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 46697.79300689697, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5658.5235595703125, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2450.876235961914}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16120.100021362305, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 26027.64081954956, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7321.268081665039, "success": true}}, "suc